 功能性产业政策与发展型国家","url":"/l-doc-books/h/political-economy/market-economy-capital/state-market/industrial-policy-debate"},{"seq":3,"slug":"welfare-redistribution","title":"福利与再分配：福利国家模型、累进税与社会安全网","url":"/l-doc-books/h/political-economy/market-economy-capital/state-market/welfare-redistribution"},{"seq":4,"slug":"public-goods-commons","title":"公共品与公地：公地悲剧、奥斯特罗姆解方与数字公地","url":"/l-doc-books/h/political-economy/market-economy-capital/state-market/public-goods-commons"}]}]}